# Astro site environment. Copy to site/.env for local work.
#
# Only PUBLIC_ variables reach the browser, which is the point: this is the one
# value the account islands need, and it is not a secret.

# The API the account surface talks to. Without it, AccountNav.astro falls back
# to the deployed API, so a local site signs you into PRODUCTION — which looks
# like a broken local login the moment the session cookie is set for the wrong
# origin.
#
# Match the port you actually run uvicorn on (api/.env.example uses 8790), and
# make sure the same origin this site is served from appears in the API's
# SITE_ORIGINS, or every account fetch fails CORS preflight.
PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8790
